  "description": "Cross-platform .NET obfuscation & hardening CLI (the `nebula` dotnet tool). Renaming, control-flow obfuscation, string/constant/resource/method encryption, reference (proxy-call) obfuscation, anti-debug/anti-tamper and metadata hardening for .NET Framework 4.8 through .NET 10 — for Windows, Linux and macOS / CI. Free edition works with no license key; Pro/Enterprise unlock more. Proprietary — see the EULA.",
