  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.5: built-in tamper telemetry (\"report-home\", tamperReportUrl) — a fired guard POSTs a minimal {\"event\":\"…\"} to your own endpoint before reacting; .NET and .NET Framework. 1.1.4: continuous environment checks (environmentChecksContinuous — AssemblyLoad hook, licensing call-site re-checks, jittered timer) and MonoMod.RuntimeDetour detection. 1.1.3: cross-platform CLI distribution (Linux/macOS/CI via dotnet tool); reference (proxy-call) obfuscation; environment & tampering-tool detection; configurable expiry guard; method-encryption anti-dump; Keyright-aware auto-protect for licensing code; metadata (#Strings heap) hardening.",
